# --help output is part of the user interface; change it on purpose with `make golden`.
exec nana --help
cmp stdout root-help.golden

exec nana version --help
cmp stdout version-help.golden

-- root-help.golden --
Pipeline checks for container images and Terraform, the same on a laptop and in CI.

Usage:
  nana [command]

Available Commands:
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  dockerfile  Read facts from a Dockerfile
  help        Help about any command
  version     Print the version this binary was built from

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for nana

Use "nana [command] --help" for more information about a command.
-- version-help.golden --
Print the version this binary was built from

Usage:
  nana version [flags]

Examples:
  nana version

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for version
